### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Copilot Query (Success Payload - Will return 503 until Core AI is running)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/copilot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "query": "Làm cách nào để bật hệ thống điều hòa HVAC trên buồng lái?"
}

###

### 3. Copilot Query (Malformed Payload - Expect 422 Error)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/copilot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "wrong_field": "This should fail Pydantic validation"
}

###

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# TERMINAL COMMANDS REFERENCE (For PowerShell)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Health Check:
# curl.exe -s http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health
#
# 2. Copilot Query (Success Payload):
# curl.exe -s -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/copilot/query -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\`"query\`": \`"Làm cách nào để bật hệ thống điều hòa HVAC trên buồng lái?\`"}"
#
# 3. Copilot Query (Malformed Payload / 422 Error):
# curl.exe -s -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/copilot/query -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d "{\`"wrong_field\`": \`"test\`"}"
